  "applicationText": {
    "title": "胡同",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "l38-app-block-001",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "走在胡同中",
        "translationZh": "走在胡同中。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（走在胡同中）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l38-app-block-002",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l38-app-block-002-line-001",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "この路地が「胡同」ですね。",
            "translationZh": "这条小巷就是“胡同”啊。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：この路地が「胡同」ですね。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l38-app-block-002-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson38/l38-app-block-002-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 2.22,
              "duration": 2.22,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:21:28.305Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "515aa4c94de71a1fc3294c8e311d1ca237b854a21a98afeda6157c46dec5d86b"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l38-app-block-002-line-002",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "ええ、この辺は北京の伝統的な町です。人が実際に生活している所ですから、写真は撮らないようにしてくださいね。",
            "translationZh": "是的，这一带是北京传统的街区。因为这里是人们实际生活的地方，请不要拍照。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：ええ、この辺は北京の伝統的な町です。人が実際に生活している所ですから、写真は撮らないようにしてくださいね。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l38-app-block-002-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson38/l38-app-block-002-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 9.34,
              "duration": 9.34,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:21:28.305Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "515aa4c94de71a1fc3294c8e311d1ca237b854a21a98afeda6157c46dec5d86b"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l38-app-block-002-line-003",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "分かりました。ところで、この道は通り抜けられますか。",
            "translationZh": "明白了。不过，这条路能走出去吗？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：分かりました。ところで、この道は通り抜けられますか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l38-app-block-002-line-003",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson38/l38-app-block-002-line-003.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 5.06,
              "duration": 5.06,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:21:28.305Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "515aa4c94de71a1fc3294c8e311d1ca237b854a21a98afeda6157c46dec5d86b"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l38-app-block-002-line-004",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "大丈夫です。入り組んでいますが、通り抜けられますよ。",
            "translationZh": "没问题。虽然道路错综复杂，但能穿过去。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：大丈夫です。入り組んでいますが、通り抜けられますよ。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l38-app-block-002-line-004",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson38/l38-app-block-002-line-004.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.9,
              "duration": 3.9,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:21:28.305Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "515aa4c94de71a1fc3294c8e311d1ca237b854a21a98afeda6157c46dec5d86b"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l38-app-block-003",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "边走边感受老北京的风情",
        "translationZh": "边走边感受老北京的风情。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（边走边感受老北京的风情）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l38-app-block-004",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l38-app-block-004-line-001",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "胡同は、古い北京が感じられて、楽しいですね。",
            "translationZh": "在胡同里能感受到老北京，真有意思啊。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：胡同は、古い北京が感じられて、楽しいですね。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l38-app-block-004-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson38/l38-app-block-004-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.74,
              "duration": 3.74,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:21:28.305Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "515aa4c94de71a1fc3294c8e311d1ca237b854a21a98afeda6157c46dec5d86b"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l38-app-block-004-line-002",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "ええ。だから、時間がある時や、外国人の友達が来た時は、胡同を歩くようにしているんですよ。",
            "translationZh": "是啊。所以有时间时，或者外国朋友来的时候，我都会到胡同里走走。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：ええ。だから、時間がある時や、外国人の友達が来た時は、胡同を歩くようにしているんですよ。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l38-app-block-004-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson38/l38-app-block-004-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 6.1,
              "duration": 6.1,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:21:28.305Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "515aa4c94de71a1fc3294c8e311d1ca237b854a21a98afeda6157c46dec5d86b"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l38-app-block-005",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "小李看到了一家卖油条的店铺",
        "translationZh": "小李看到了一家卖油条的店铺。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（小李看到了一家卖油条的店铺）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l38-app-block-006",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l38-app-block-006-line-001",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "小野さん、「油条」は食べられますか。",
            "translationZh": "小野女士，你能吃油条吗？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：小野さん、「油条」は食べられますか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l38-app-block-006-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson38/l38-app-block-006-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.58,
              "duration": 3.58,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:21:28.305Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "515aa4c94de71a1fc3294c8e311d1ca237b854a21a98afeda6157c46dec5d86b"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l38-app-block-006-line-002",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "ええ、大好きです。",
            "translationZh": "嗯，我很喜欢。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：ええ、大好きです。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l38-app-block-006-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson38/l38-app-block-006-line-002.mp3",
